# ---- II
ch("II", "The inner fortress")
s("Picture your mind as a fortress. At its centre, in the keep, sits a king.", ["castle"], big="fortress")
s("On the walls stand the guards: your good thoughts, watching.", ["castle", "knight"])
s("And outside the gate, always, the enemy waits.", ["castle", "demon"], big="enemy")
s("He looks for the unguarded corner, the sleepy sentry, the guard who can be bought, the drawbridge lowered quietly in the night.", ["castle", "night"], big="drawbridge")
