s("Said each time a temptation knocks, it makes the walls much harder to breach.", ["prayer", "castle"])
s("Christ tells his disciples again and again to watch, and to stay awake.", ["christ", "night"], big="watch")
s("If instead we let the dark thoughts in, and indulge them, and forget them, by nightfall they have piled into one heavy mass on the soul.", ["night", "despair"])
