s("Then discipline: the daily practice of saying no to the lower appetites.", ["monk", "forge"], big="discipline")
s("Rise early. Keep a rule for your day. Train the body. Fast. Pray. Keep silence.", ["morning", "monk"])
s("In the Gospel of Luke, Christ describes an unclean spirit that leaves a man, wanders through dry places, and finds no rest.", ["desert", "christ"])
