s("Then it brings seven other spirits worse than itself, and the last state of that man is worse than the first.", ["demon", "hell"], big="seven")
s("Clearing the house is not enough. Someone has to live there.", ["interior", "light"], big="live")
s("It is not only casting out the darkness. It is inviting God in.", ["light", "church"])
s("And it is never thinking that the work is done. If we say we have no sin, Saint John writes, we deceive ourselves.", ["saint", "book"], big="deceive")
