# ---- IV
ch("IV", "Talking back")
s("In the fourth century, a monk named Evagrius of Pontus wrote a handbook for this battle.", ["monk", "desert"], big="Evagrius")
s("He called it Antirrhetikos, which means talking back.", ["book", "monk"], big="talking")
