s("His book gathers some five hundred passages, arranged against eight thoughts.", ["book"])
s("Gluttony. Lust. Love of money. Sadness. Anger. Listlessness. Vainglory. Pride.", ["demon", "hell"], gap=1.4)
s("Centuries later, that list became the seven deadly sins.", ["hell", "church"])
