s("Against the pride that whispers you are now pure: I, who am but dust and ashes.", ["monk", "skull"], big="dust", gap=1.4)
s("For Evagrius, these thoughts were not simply moods of the soul. They were the means by which something outside us attacks.", ["demon", "shadow"])
